---
// Audience-first homepage: researchers, contributors, funders. Uses the global --f-* tokens from theme.css,
// which switch with Starlight's [data-theme]. Rendered inside a `template: splash` page.
---

<div class="home">
  <section class="hero shell">
    <div class="herogrid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">An open platform for palaeography</p>
        <h1>Read the hands<br />of the past.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Archetype lets scholars search, view, annotate, and teach with manuscript images and the texts they carry &mdash; built for researchers, editorial teams, libraries and museums.</p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="btn primary" href="https://beta.archetype-pal.ink">Try the live corpus <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="#start">Find your way in <span class="arw">&darr;</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="creds" aria-label="Why Archetype is built to last">
        <h2 class="creds-h">Open &middot; standards-based &middot; enduring</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><span class="di"></span><span><b>Open source.</b> Developed in the open and built to self-host; the licence is being chosen now.</span></li>
          <li><span class="di"></span><span><b>Standards at the core.</b> IIIF imaging, TEI text, and W3C Web Annotations &mdash; no lock-in.</span></li>
          <li><span class="di"></span><span><b>Your collection stays yours.</b> Runs on your servers, over your own manuscripts.</span></li>
          <li><span class="di"></span><span><b>Rooted in scholarship.</b> Fifteen years of the DigiPal research method, rebuilt.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="block shell" id="start">
    <div class="sechead"><p class="eyebrow">Find your way in</p><h2>What brings you here?</h2></div>
    <div class="doors">
      <div class="door">
        <p class="eyebrow">Researchers</p>
        <h3>Use it in your research</h3>
        <p class="sub">Search, annotate and compare manuscripts, on our live corpus or your own, and cite what you find.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/researchers/">Start here</a></li>
          <li><a href="/researchers/palaeography/">How script is described</a></li>
          <li><a href="/researchers/interoperability/">Export, reuse &amp; cite</a></li>
        </ul>
        <a class="go" href="/researchers/">For researchers <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="door">
        <p class="eyebrow">Contributors</p>
        <h3>Run it and help build it</h3>
        <p class="sub">Install Archetype locally, host an instance for a project, or send a change to the code or docs.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/contributors/local-setup/">Run it locally</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contributors/production/">Host an instance</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contributors/workflow/">Contribution workflow</a></li>
        </ul>
        <a class="go" href="/contributors/">For contributors <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="door">
        <p class="eyebrow">Funders</p>
        <h3>Decide whether to back it</h3>
        <p class="sub">What already works, who it serves, how it is run, and where funding would make the difference.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/funders/">The case for Archetype</a></li>
          <li><a href="/funders/status/">What works today</a></li>
          <li><a href="/funders/roadmap/">Roadmap &amp; priorities</a></li>
        </ul>
        <a class="go" href="/funders/">For funders <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block shell">
    <div class="proof">
      <div class="proof-text">
        <p class="eyebrow">Live today</p>
        <h2>A real corpus, in public</h2>
        <p class="sub">The public beta runs Archetype over <em>Models of Authority</em>, the Scottish royal charters of 1100&ndash;1250. Figures from October 2026.</p>
      </div>
      <dl class="stats">
        <div><dt>Charters</dt><dd>710</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Page images</dt><dd>3,000</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Annotated letter-forms</dt><dd>12,700</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Scribal hands</dt><dd>700</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block shell">
    <div class="sechead">
      <p class="eyebrow">What it does today</p>
      <h2>A working platform for manuscript study</h2>
      <p class="sub">Everything here is live in the platform now &mdash; the tools scholars use to work closely with the written record.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feat-grid">
      <a class="feat" href="/researchers/search/"><h3>Search the corpus</h3><p>Find manuscripts by script, scribe, date or repository with fast, faceted search across an entire collection.</p></a>
      <a class="feat" href="/researchers/imaging/"><h3>Examine every stroke</h3><p>Standards-based IIIF deep-zoom renders high-resolution images down to the finest detail of the pen.</p></a>
      <a class="feat" href="/researchers/annotation/"><h3>Annotate the hand</h3><p>Mark up glyphs, allographs and scribal features directly on the image, and browse them in a gallery.</p></a>
      <a class="feat" href="/researchers/data-model/"><h3>Describe hands &amp; scribes</h3><p>Catalogue scribal hands, allographs and their components as structured, searchable data.</p></a>
      <a class="feat" href="/researchers/annotation/"><h3>Tie text to image</h3><p>Link transcriptions to the exact region they describe, on a TEI-canonical model of the text.</p></a>
      <a class="feat" href="/researchers/lightbox/"><h3>Compare hands side by side</h3><p>Assemble worksets and set scribal hands next to one another in a digital lightbox, with notes and shareable views.</p></a>
      <a class="feat" href="/researchers/workflow/"><h3>Edit with an audit trail</h3><p>Move transcriptions from draft to reviewed to published &mdash; every change attributed and dated.</p></a>
      <a class="feat" href="/researchers/interoperability/"><h3>Publish to standards</h3><p>Export images and annotations as IIIF manifests, TEI, and W3C Web Annotations for reuse anywhere.</p></a>
      <a class="feat" href="/researchers/lightbox/"><h3>Teach and share</h3><p>Build curated worksets for the seminar room and share them without exposing your working files.</p></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block shell">
    <div class="roadband">
      <div class="rb-text">
        <p class="eyebrow">Where it's headed</p>
        <h2>The road ahead</h2>
        <p class="sub">Beyond today's platform, the roadmap sets out the goals we're working toward &mdash; annotation analytics and quality control, richer interoperability, and a grant-dependent AI-assisted research programme with the scholar always the author of record.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn ghost rb-cta" href="/funders/roadmap/">See the full roadmap <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
  .home { color: var(--f-text); font-family: var(--sl-font); line-height: 1.6; letter-spacing: -0.005em; }
  .home .shell { max-width: 1200px; margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: clamp(1.2rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); }
  .home a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
  .home h1, .home h2, .home h3 { font-family: var(--sl-font-headings); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.012em; margin: 0; text-wrap: balance; }
  .home .eyebrow { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.19em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--f-dim); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; margin: 0; }
  .home .eyebrow::before { content: ""; width: 24px; height: 2px; background: var(--f-accent); margin-right: 0.7rem; flex: none; }

  .home .btn { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.94rem; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.72rem 1.2rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; border: 1px solid transparent; transition: transform 0.16s, background 0.16s, border-color 0.16s, color 0.16s; }
  .home .btn .arw { transition: transform 0.18s; }
  .home .btn:hover .arw { transform: translateX(3px); }
  .home .btn.primary { background: var(--f-btn-bg); color: var(--f-btn-fg); }
  .home .btn.primary:hover { background: var(--f-btn-bg-hi); }
  .home .btn.ghost { border-color: var(--f-border-strong); color: var(--f-text); }
  .home .btn.ghost:hover { border-color: var(--f-accent); color: var(--f-accent); }

  /* hero */
  .home .hero { padding: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4rem) 0 clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.4rem); }
  .home .hero .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 1.3rem; }
  .home .herogrid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); align-items: center; }
  .home .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 6.4vw, 4.6rem); line-height: 1; }
  .home .hero .lead { max-width: 40ch; color: var(--f-muted); font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.55vw, 1.26rem); margin: 1.5rem 0 0; font-family: var(--sl-font-headings); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; }
  .home .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.7rem; margin-top: 1.9rem; }

  .home .creds { background: var(--f-surface); border: 1px solid var(--f-border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.7rem 1.8rem; box-shadow: var(--f-shadow); }
  .home .creds-h { font-family: var(--sl-font); font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--f-dim); margin: 0 0 1.3rem; font-weight: 600; padding-bottom: 0.9rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--f-border); }
  .home .creds ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.05rem; }
  .home .creds li { display: flex; gap: 0.8rem; align-items: flex-start; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--f-muted); line-height: 1.45; }
  .home .creds li b { color: var(--f-text); font-weight: 600; }
  .home .creds .di { flex: none; width: 7px; height: 7px; background: var(--f-accent); transform: rotate(45deg); margin-top: 0.42rem; }

  /* sections */
  .home .block { padding: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, 3.6rem) 0; }
  .home .sechead { margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 62ch; }
  .home .sechead h2 { font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 3vw, 2.4rem); margin-top: 0.7rem; }
  .home .sechead .sub { margin: 0.7rem 0 0; color: var(--f-muted); font-size: 1.02rem; font-family: var(--sl-font-headings); }

  /* capabilities grid */
  .home .feat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1px; background: var(--f-border); border: 1px solid var(--f-border); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
  .home .feat { background: var(--f-surface); padding: 1.5rem 1.55rem; transition: background 0.18s; }
  .home .feat:hover { background: var(--f-surface-2); }
  .home .feat:hover h3 { color: var(--f-accent); }
  .home .feat h3 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 0 0 0.55rem; transition: color 0.18s; }
  .home .feat h3::before { content: ""; display: block; width: 26px; height: 2px; background: var(--f-accent); margin-bottom: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.85; }
  .home .feat p { color: var(--f-muted); font-size: 0.92rem; margin: 0; line-height: 1.55; }

  /* roadmap band */
  .home .roadband { background: var(--f-surface); border: 1px solid var(--f-border); border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: var(--f-shadow); padding: clamp(1.8rem, 3.4vw, 2.8rem); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.6fr auto; gap: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.6rem); align-items: center; }
  .home .roadband .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
  .home .roadband h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.6vw, 2.05rem); }
  .home .roadband .sub { color: var(--f-muted); margin: 0.7rem 0 0; max-width: 64ch; font-size: 1rem; font-family: var(--sl-font-headings); }
  .home .roadband .rb-cta { justify-self: end; }

  /* audience doors */
  .home .doors { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
  .home .door { background: var(--f-surface); border: 1px solid var(--f-border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.7rem 1.7rem 1.5rem; box-shadow: var(--f-shadow); display: flex; flex-direction: column; transition: border-color 0.18s, box-shadow 0.18s; }
  .home .door:hover { border-color: var(--f-accent); box-shadow: var(--f-shadow-lift); }
  .home .door .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
  .home .door h3 { font-size: 1.45rem; }
  .home .door .sub { color: var(--f-muted); margin: 0.6rem 0 1rem; font-size: 0.95rem; font-family: var(--sl-font-headings); }
  .home .door ul { list-style: none; margin: 0 0 1.2rem; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.45rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--f-border); padding-top: 1rem; }
  .home .door li a { font-size: 0.93rem; color: var(--f-text); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; }
  .home .door li a:hover { color: var(--f-accent); border-bottom-color: var(--f-accent); }
  .home .door .go { margin-top: auto; color: var(--f-accent); font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; gap: 0.45rem; align-items: center; font-size: 0.92rem; }
  .home .door .go .arw { transition: transform 0.18s; }
  .home .door .go:hover .arw { transform: translateX(3px); }

  .home .doors > *, .home .stats > *, .home .door ul > * { margin-top: 0; }

  /* live-corpus figures */
  .home .proof { background: var(--f-surface); border: 1px solid var(--f-border); border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: var(--f-shadow); padding: clamp(1.8rem, 3.4vw, 2.8rem); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr; gap: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.6rem); align-items: center; }
  .home .proof .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
  .home .proof h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.6vw, 2.05rem); }
  .home .proof .sub { color: var(--f-muted); margin: 0.7rem 0 0; font-size: 1rem; font-family: var(--sl-font-headings); }
  .home .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: var(--f-border); border: 1px solid var(--f-border); border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; margin: 0; }
  .home .stats div { background: var(--f-surface); padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem; }
  .home .stats dt { font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--f-dim); font-weight: 600; }
  .home .stats dd { margin: 0.3rem 0 0; padding: 0; margin-inline-start: 0; font-family: var(--sl-font-headings); font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.3rem); font-weight: 600; color: var(--f-text); }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .home .herogrid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .home .roadband { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .home .roadband .rb-cta { justify-self: start; }
    .home .doors { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .home .proof { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .home .btn:hover .arw, .home .door .go:hover .arw { transform: none; }
  }
</style>
